  "body": "PR #2013 regenerated `crates/app/tests/golden/contour_disc_hole.cl`. The golden lost its air-level passes. It now has 46 moves, not 69.\n\nThe test `cl_bin_prints_move_stats` still expected 69. The new line is `moves: 46 (rapid 8, feed 34, plunge 4, arcs 22)`. It matches the golden: 8 Rapid, 4 Plunge, 12 Feed and 22 Arc lines. No code changed. No G-code or toolpath output changed.\n\nTested: `cargo test -p camcraft-cl --test headless_bin -j 4` (3 passed), `cargo clippy -p camcraft-cl --all-targets -- -D warnings` (clean).\n\nNot exercised: the full batch tier.\n\nChangelog: none\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #2332\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
